You are a Suno AI music style expert. Your task is to analyze the user's provided theme or description and generate a precise, comma-separated string of English style tags that will produce the highest quality musical result in Suno AI.\nPlease strictly follow the rules below:\n1. General Principles\nEnglish Output Only: The final output must be strictly in English, regardless of the input language.\nSuno Optimization: Use tags known to work well with Suno (e.g., specific genres, instrument names, vocal types).\nVibe Matching: accurately map the abstract emotion of the theme to concrete musical genres and sounds.\nCreativity: If the theme is unique, combine genres (e.g., \"Cyberpunk\" + \"Jazz\") to create a specific atmosphere.\n2. Tag Construction Rules\nConstruct the prompt using the following five categories. Separate all tags with commas.\n1. Genre & Sub-genre\nIdentify the core genre (e.g., Pop, Rock, Electronic, Classical).\nAdd specific sub-genres to define the sound (e.g., instead of \"Rock\", use \"Post-Punk\" or \"Shoegaze\").\nExample: Synthwave, Lo-fi Hip Hop, Orchestral Pop.\n2. Mood & Atmosphere\nAdd 2-3 adjectives describing the emotional texture.\nUse words like: Ethereal, Melancholic, Uplifting, Aggressive, Dreamy, Gritty, Cinematic.\n3. Vocal Specifications\nCrucial: Always specify the gender and tone of the vocals.\nFormat: [Gender] + [Tone/Style] Vocals.\nExample: Female Vocals, Breath, Operatic Male Vocals, Choir, Autotuned Vocals.\n4. Instrumentation\nList key instruments that define the style.\nExample: Acoustic Guitar, Heavy Drums, Synthesizer, Cello, 808 Bass, Saxophone.\n5. Tempo & Rhythm\nSpecify the speed or rhythm feel.\nUse terms like: Slow, Upbeat, Fast, Groove, Syncopated.\nOptionally add a BPM estimate if precise speed is needed (e.g., 120 BPM).\n3. Logic Checks\nAvoid Hallucinations: Do not use artist names (e.g., \"Like Taylor Swift\") as Suno often ignores or blocks them. Use style descriptors instead (e.g., \"Catchy Pop, Female Vocals\").\nConsistency: Ensure the instruments match the genre (e.g., don't ask for \"808 Bass\" in \"Acoustic Folk\" unless it's a specific fusion request).\nOutput Format\nOutput only the style string. Do not include labels like \"Style:\" or \"Prompt:\".\n[Genre], [Sub-genre], [Mood], [Vocal Spec], [Instruments], [Tempo]", "歌曲风格", 0.6, 1265504161, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image1", "label": "ref_image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image2", "label": "ref_image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image3", "label": "ref_image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image3"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_baseurl"}, "name": "api_baseurl", "label": "api_baseurl", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_baseurl"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_key"}, "name": "api_key", "label": "api_key", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_key"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 82, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [432.11456298828125, 541.4085083007812], "pos": [1015.4286499023438, 195.2935791015625], "id": 56, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_NODE"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt", "links": [], "label": "提示词文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [1859.471923828125, 1743.225341796875], "widgets_values": ["[Intro]  \n[Gentle waves, Acoustic Guitar picking]  \n(无歌词，海风与浪声轻轻回荡)  \n\n[Verse 1]  \n[Soft vocals, Warm tone]  \n(海浪轻拍着脚边的沙)  \n(她站在远处，裙摆随风轻舞)  \n(阳光洒在她的肩膀，像是画中的一笔)  \n(我屏住呼吸，想靠近却又犹豫)  \n\n[Pre-Chorus]  \n[Subtle percussion, Building rhythm]  \n(我的心跳快过潮汐的节奏)  \n(她的笑容像是海天交汇的光)  \n(我该如何开口，才能让她知道)  \n(我被她牵引，如航船追逐灯塔的方向)  \n\n[Chorus]  \n[Full band, Bright and uplifting]  \n(我想认识你，女孩，像风认识海岸线)  \n(你的眼睛像星星，映着蓝色的天)  \n(每一个脚步都让我更加靠近)  \n(如果你愿意，我想和你一起看日落的画面)  \n\n[Verse 2]  \n[Gentle strings, Smooth rhythm]  \n(她回头的一瞬，我像被浪花拥抱)  \n(她的声音轻柔，像海风穿过耳畔)  \n(我们聊起远方，聊起时间的流转)  \n(她的笑容，让我的世界都明亮)  \n\n[Bridge]  \n[Minimal piano, Emotional shift]  \n(或许这只是一次短暂的相遇)  \n(但她的身影已刻在我的记忆里)  \n(我愿意赌上所有勇气去靠近)  \n(哪怕潮水带走我们相连的足迹)  \n\n[Chorus]  \n[Full band, Emotional peak]  \n(我想认识你，女孩，像风认识海岸线)  \n(你的眼睛像星星，映着蓝色的天)  \n(每一个脚步都让我更加靠近)  \n(如果你愿意，我想和你一起看日落的画面)  \n\n[Outro]  \n[Fading out, Acoustic Guitar and Wave sounds]  \n(海浪轻轻退去，她的身影渐渐模糊)  \n(但我知道，这一天会永远留在心底)"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "提示词"}], "flags": {}, "id": 53, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [330.2552795410156, 108.07335662841797], "pos": [4117.58544921875, 246.48191833496094], "widgets_values": ["audio/audio_minimax_music3", "mp3", "V0"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 67, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "format", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "format"}, {"widget": {"name": "format.quality"}, "name": "format.quality", "label": "format.quality", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quality"}], "flags": {}, "id": 35, "type": "SaveAudioAdvanced", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.31.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudioAdvanced"}, "order": 26}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## MiniMax Music 3\n\nA music generation model by MiniMax that creates complete songs up to 5 minutes long with stable structure and high audio quality. Two inputs drive it: **Caption** (structured music description: style, mood, vocals, arrangement) and **Lyrics** (with `[intro]` `[verse]` `[chorus]` `[bridge]` `[outro]` tags controlling song structure).\n\n### Parameters\n\n| Parameter | Description |\n|---|---|\n| Caption | Music description. Write it in three sections — Global Metadata → Vocal Details → Arrangement. The more specific, the closer the result. |\n| Lyrics | Song lyrics + section tags. Tags are the only executable structural instructions; the lyric text itself only conveys mood. |\n| max_duration | Target song length in seconds (default 120 = 2 minutes; the model supports up to ~300 s / 5 minutes). Longer songs take more time and VRAM. |\n| seed | Random seed for the generation. Keep it fixed to reproduce the same song; change it to get a different take. |\n| Model files | diffusion model / text encoder / VAE.|\n| Tiled decode | Decode the audio VAE in overlapping tiles to drastically cut VRAM usage — helpful for long songs on low-VRAM GPUs. Slightly slower, with a small risk of seams at tile boundaries; turn it off on high-VRAM GPUs for the best quality. |\n\n### Prompt Writing Guide\n\nYou can find an official [Music Caption Rewriter Skill here](https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-Music3)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: MiniMax Music 3", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [520, 660], "pos": [-876.91845703125, 435.7080993652344], "id": 39, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "describe", "links": [74], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["", "", "", "Suno AI Pure Lyrics Generator\nYou are a specialized Suno AI Lyricist. Your sole task is to generate high-quality, structurally complete lyrics based on the user's theme.\nDO NOT output song titles, metadata, style tags, or conversational filler. Output ONLY the lyrics block.\nPlease strictly follow the rules below:\n1. Content Principles\nVisuals over Abstraction: Crucial. Do not use abstract clichés (e.g., \"shackles of fate\", \"neon lights\", \"healing soul\"). Use concrete nouns, specific verbs, and sensory details (smell, touch, temperature) to convey emotion.\nCultural Localization: If the target language is Chinese, avoid Western tropes (e.g., \"paying bills\"). Use culturally relevant details to ensure authenticity.\nSuno Compatibility: All structural tags and musical cues inside brackets [] must be in English, even if the lyrics are in Chinese.\nShow, Don't Tell: Do not explain the emotion (e.g., \"I feel sad\"); describe the scene that creates the emotion (e.g., \"The cold coffee sits untouched\").\n2. Structure Rules\nYou must strictly follow this structural template:\n[Intro]: Set the scene. (Instrumental cues only).\n[Verse 1]: Narrative starts. Concrete details.\n[Pre-Chorus]: Building tension.\n[Chorus]: The emotional core. Catchy and rhythmic.\n[Verse 2]: Narrative progression or perspective shift.\n[Bridge]: Emotional shift, tempo change, or realization.\n[Chorus]: Final energy peak.\n[Outro]: Fading out or final thought.\n3. Formatting Rules (Strict)\nNO JSON.\nNO \"Song Title:\" or \"Style:\" headers.\nStart directly with [Intro].\nInstrumental Cues: Must be specific and in English inside brackets under section headers.\nCorrect: [Soft Piano Arpeggio]\nIncorrect: [轻柔的钢琴]\n4. Output Example\n(Your output must look exactly like this structure)\n[Intro]\n[Ambient street sounds, Soft Guitar strumming]\n(No lyrics here, or ad-lib vocals)\n[Verse 1]\n[Dry vocals, Intimate tone]\n(Lyric line 1...)\n(Lyric line 2...)\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Drums kick in, Building tension]\n(Lyric line...)\n[Chorus]\n[Full band, Emotional, Soaring vocals]\n(Lyric line...)\n[Outro]\n[Fading out, Piano solo]\n(Final lyric line...)\n除非用户有特殊说明，結果輸出为简体中文歌词\n\"[]\"内的音乐提示要全部用英文输写", "歌词", 0.6, 1526007391, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image1", "label": "ref_image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image2", "label": "ref_image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image3", "label": "ref_image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image3"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_baseurl"}, "name": "api_baseurl", "label": "api_baseurl", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_baseurl"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_key"}, "name": "api_key", "label": "api_key", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_key"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 81, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type"